      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm in agreement, but it shouldn't give me VALID DATA when it does.  How am I supposed to discern a new user from a user who simply reset their data?  Why doesn't resetting data behave the same way?  I can check for null data sets as long as I know I'm supposed to.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
